Requires:
 7 Strength

Weight: 5"


	SAY NAME2 "Impaler +3"
	SAY DESC "The Impaler radiates a palpable, thrumming aura of magic—a silent testament to the weapon's sheer, unadulterated brutality. It is easy to see why this spear was the prized possession of several legendary orc chieftains, leaders who valued raw devastation above all else. When the spear strikes, its massive enchantment drives the point forward with terrifying, supernatural force. Victims are not merely wounded; they are violently run through, as the weapon's savage magic tears through armor and bone alike to complete its grim work.

STATISTICS:

THAC0: +3
Damage: 1d8+10 (piercing)
Speed Factor: 3
Proficiency Type: Spear
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 7 Strength

Weight: 3" 




