//IXIL'S NAIL +5 - valore 10000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/SPER11.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Spear"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "One of the earliest weapons, dating back to the most primitive of times, the first spears were simply wooden poles or sticks sharpened at one end. When the civilized races mastered metals, spearheads were made from iron and steel. Having reached this end, weaponsmiths began experimenting with different types of spearheads, thus leading to the development of certain polearm types.

STATISTICS:

Damage: 1d8 (piercing)
Speed Factor: 6
Proficiency Type: Spear
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 7 Strength

Weight: 5"


	SAY NAME2 "Ixil's Nail +5"
	SAY DESC "This spear is a weapon of terrifying elegance, crafted from a single, seamless rod of blackened obsidian, while the head is a jagged, crystalline spike known as the 'Nail of Ixil'—a fragment of an ancient, sentient mountain that was shattered by a divine blow.
	
	For many generations, this magical shaft has been separated from Ixil's Spike, the enchanted head of this legendary spear. However, even incomplete, this artifact is still a weapon of great power. 

STATISTICS:

THAC0: +5
Damage: 1d8+5 (piercing)
Speed Factor: 1
Proficiency Type: Spear 
Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 7 Strength

Weight: 2" 




